OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh Zoo's red panda goes to
OL,4,Athe vet for toothache
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh Zoo's red panda makes a visit
OL,7,Fto the dentist look easy after having
OL,8,Fhis tooth removed during a health
OL,9,Fcheck-up.
OL,11,FKeepers noticed that Bruce was not
OL,12,Feating his food. They sent him to Royal
OL,13,FZoological Society of Scotland vets who
OL,14,Fdiscovered he was suffering from
OL,15,Ftoothache.
OL,17,FEleven-year-old Bruce laid on his back
OL,18,Funder a general anaesthetic, as they
OL,19,Fremoved the problem tooth and checked
OL,20,Fhim for other illnesses.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
