OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh Zoo's red panda goes to
OL,4,Athe vet for toothache
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe endangered red panda, who arrived
OL,7,Fin Edinburgh in 2016, was given a clean
OL,8,Fbill of health and returned to his
OL,9,Fhabitat.
